Description: 3D real time strategy game
 In Warzone 2100 you command the forces of "The Project" in a battle to
 rebuild the world after mankind has almost been destroyed by nuclear
 missiles.
 .
 Release 4.3.5, the last one with an OpenGL 2.1 / OpenGL ES 2.0 renderer
 (GLSL 1.20 shaders). The PS3 build has the Vulkan backend, Basis Universal
 texture support and the Discord integration turned off.
 .
 The campaign video sequences are not distributed here.

